<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"lgsdn-type-lead"} --><p class="lgsdn-type-lead">How this community resource was made, why it exists and how you can help improve it.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__body","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__body"><!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Why this website exists</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The Local Government Service Design Network brings people together to share experience and practical knowledge. This website makes that learning available for others to use and build on.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Research and support</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>This website forms part of a research-funded effort to give back to the local government service design community.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Design and development</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Designed and built by <a href="mailto:hello@gfoot.me">Gareth Foote</a>. The website is built with WordPress, using a custom LGSDN theme and plugin. Its design and development are iterative, informed by the needs of the community.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">How we use AI</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>AI tools have supported code drafting, troubleshooting and exploration of design and content options during development. Human review remains part of the development process.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Typography and readability</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We use Atkinson Hyperlegible Next for body text, navigation and controls. Created by the Braille Institute, it is designed to make letters and numbers easier to distinguish, particularly for readers with low vision. We chose it to support clear, comfortable reading throughout the website.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href="https://www.brailleinstitute.org/freefont/">Explore Atkinson Hyperlegible and the thinking behind its design</a>. The font is free to download and use.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Headings use <a href="https://www.srbijasans.rs/">Srbija Sans</a>.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Icons and other credits</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Service area and resource icons are by the following creators, from <a href="https://thenounproject.com/">The Noun Project</a>. Icons have been resized, recoloured and prepared for the service area cards and resource headings.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
