<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Understanding our impact</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We want to understand which resources people use, the countries visits come from and how the website helps people in their work. This will help us improve the website and describe the reach of this research-funded resource. Read our <a href="/privacy/">privacy and analytics information</a>.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
